// подсказки (HelpWindow справа) и заголовки разделов
Preset_Button_Help Sets all graphics options at once, from Potato for weak PCs to Ultra. Changing any option by hand makes the preset Custom.
Ambient_Occlusion_Help Soft shadows in corners, gaps and joints. Adds depth to the image at a small FPS cost.
Bloom_Toggle_Help Glow around bright lights and highlights.
Color_Grading_Toggle_Help Final color processing: tonemapping and saturation. Without it the image looks flat and dull.
Chromatic_Aberration_Toggle_Help Colored fringes on objects near the screen edges, like a cheap camera lens.
Film_Grain_Toggle_Help Light noise over the image, like on film.
Grass_Displacement_Toggle_Help Grass bends under players and vehicles.
Wind_Toggle_Help Trees, bushes and grass sway in the wind.
Ragdolls_Toggle_Help Bodies of players and animals fall with physics after death. Off: bodies do not appear.
Debris_Toggle_Help Debris when buildings and objects are destroyed.
Puddle_Toggle_Help Puddles and ripples from raindrops when it rains.
Triplanar_Toggle_Help Removes stretched textures on steep slopes and cliffs.
Far_Clip_Slider_Help How far you can see the world at all: fog hides everything beyond. Higher shows more but lowers FPS.
Distance_Slider_Help Distance at which buildings, trees and items are drawn in full. Noticeably affects FPS.
Landmark_Slider_Help How far simplified distant buildings and cliffs are visible.
Render_Scale_Slider_Help World resolution relative to the screen: above 100% smooths edges and grass, below 100% gains FPS.
Landmark_Button_Help Simplified houses and cliffs beyond the draw distance. Strongly affects FPS.
Anti_Aliasing_Button_Help Smooths jagged edges. FXAA is softer, SMAA is sharper, both barely affect FPS.
Effect_Button_Help How long particles live: smoke, sparks, dust. Lower makes effects disappear sooner.
Foliage_Button_Help Density of grass and small rocks. Strongly affects FPS.
Sun_Shafts_Button_Help Sun rays through foliage and clouds.
Lighting_Button_Help Shadow quality and distance. Noticeably affects FPS.
Planar_Reflection_Button_Help Reflections of the world in water. Strongly affects FPS.
Water_Button_Help Water transparency, shore foam and waves. The most expensive option: strongly affects FPS.
Scope_Button_Help Sharpness of the image in a scope.
Outline_Button_Help Quality of the outline on items and vehicles you look at.
Terrain_Button_Help Detail of the terrain surface in the distance.
Anisotropic_Filtering_Button_Help Sharpness of textures at an angle, like the ground in the distance. Barely affects FPS.
